OL,3,GNEWSAGoose cull among options to tackle
OL,4,Ahealth risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has said it is considering
OL,7,Fculling Canada Geese in a green space
OL,8,Fas the birds' excrement is causing a
OL,9,Fhealth risk.
OL,11,FHigh Peak Borough Council has carried
OL,12,Fout more cleaning around play areas and
OL,13,Fhas put up signs in Pavilion Gardens,
OL,14,FBuxton, urging people not to feed geese
OL,15,Fdue to an E. coli risk linked to its
OL,16,Fexcrement.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
