OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAGoose cull among options to tackle
OL,4,Ahealth risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FDamien Greenhalgh, deputy leader of the
OL,7,Fauthority, said: "We need to look at
OL,8,Fevery single option. We're not at that
OL,9,Fpoint yet, but that's potentially where
OL,10,Fwe may end [a cull]. We're trying every
OL,11,Fsingle non-lethal method."
OL,13,FIndependent councillor Madeline Hall
OL,14,Fsaid a cull would be ineffective as the
OL,15,Fbirds would simply return, arguing
OL,16,Fother measures would have more impact.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
